SUMMARY:Reset at Jubilee
DESCRIPTION:Jubilee\, the joyful neighborhood in Hockley\, northwest of Houston\, celebrates Wellness Month with Reset\, a free evening designed to help everyone relax\, recharge\, and reconnect. \nOpen to everyone who RSVPs for free\, Reset offers yoga\, Zumba\, chair massages\, wellness activities and more at JoyHub\, Jubilee’s community recreation center. \nAs the evening winds down\, guests will gather by the water for a beautiful floating lantern release—a peaceful way to let go\, reflect and set an intention for what’s ahead. \nAdmission\nTickets are free with RSVP. RSVP now or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/reset-at-jubilee/
LOCATION:Jubilee Model Home Haven\, 26134 Happy Home St\, Hockley\, TX\, 77447\, United States
CATEGORIES:Architecture & Design,Bingo, Trivia & Games,Boosted Calendar Listing,Community & Giving,Date Night,Experiences & Adventures,Featured,Free,Health & Wellness,Home & Living,Kids & Families,Mixers,Outdoors,Pop-Ups
