SUMMARY:Boxing: Rolly Romero vs Teofimo Lopez Watch Party at Social Beer Garden HTX
DESCRIPTION:Social Beer Garden HTX hosts a watch party for the WBA Welterweight World Championship and the showdown between Rolly Romero and Teofimo Lopez live. \nIt will be an evening of intense boxing action in Midtown. \n\n\nMultiple food trucks will be on site. \n\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover. Learn more. \n\n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
