DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Grupo Duelo\, and their Gravedad Tour 2026\, for 3 consecutive nights on the arena stage in Downtown Houston. \nFor 26 years\, Grupo Duelo has established itself as one of the leading forces in romantic norteño across Mexico and the United States. \nThis new chapter marks an evolution in the band’s journey\, introducing a reimagined show that elevates their artistic vision through a striking stage production and a deeply moving musical experience. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $45. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/grupo-duelo-in-concert-at-toyota-center-2/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Date Night,Featured,Nightlife
