SUMMARY:Classic Albums Live: The Eagles' Hotel California at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre welcomes Classic Albums Live back to the Hermann Park stage for a live concert recreating The Eagles’ Hotel California note for note and cut for cut under the stars. \nHotel California is one of the best-selling albums of all time by one of the most renowned American rock bands in music history. \nGuests can sing along to favorite songs like “Victim of Love”\, “Life in the Fast Lane”\, “Hotel California”\, and more—all played to perfect perfection. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-live-the-eagles-hotel-california-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
