SUMMARY:Cirque-tacular: The Art of Circus at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre presents Cirque-tacular: The Art of Circus under the stars on the Hermann Park stage. \nStep into a world where Van Gogh’s swirling skies\, Da Vinci’s timeless genius\, and Picasso’s bold visions leap off the canvas and into motion. \nThe Art of Circus reimagines history’s greatest masterpieces through gravity-defying acrobatics\, mesmerizing dance\, and jaw-dropping feats of strength and grace. \nWith costumes inspired by iconic works\, a musical score that sweeps you through centuries of artistic brilliance\, and a cast of world-class performers\, this production transforms the stage into a living gallery. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/cirque-tacular-the-art-of-circus-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
